    "body": "Hello, \r\nGDPR will start to apply in May 2018. More informations [here.](http://ec.europa.eu/justice/data-protection/reform/files/regulation_oj_en.pdf). LHC can collect personal data like IP adress, e-mail etc. If we want to use LHC, we need some tools and settings. For exapmplet anonymisation of IP, automated data deletion in time period or log for user cofirmation of agree with data processing. In this time LHC has some of this tools, but not all. Do you plan to make LHC fully comply with GDPR? It's very importat for all EU users.\r\nThank you.",
